# The front page's recording, about twenty seconds: editing with selections, a
# shell whose output becomes a chart, and Greed's agent proposing an edit
# you accept. The model is scripted in the demo profile; hero.png, the
# poster, is the agent's answer.
size 1280 800
fps 30
typing 0.025
show-keys
hide
keys :
type open src/worker.rs
keys enter
wait-for ATTEMPTS
keys /
type fn connect
keys enter
show
wait 0.6

caption Select every attempt in the function, then rename them together
keys m i f
wait 0.7
keys s
type \battempt\b
keys enter
wait 0.7
keys c
type try
keys esc
wait 1.2

caption Command output as a table, filtered and charted
keys :
type shell
keys enter
wait-for ❯
type printf 'NAME  CPU\napi   42\nworker 87\nweb   12\n' | columns | where CPU > 20 | chart CPU
keys enter
wait 2

caption The agent proposes an edit; it's applied once you allow it
keys esc
keys space b
type worker
keys enter
keys space i n
type Greed
keys enter
type project
keys enter
type The worker pod keeps crashing. Why?
keys alt-enter
wait-for Allow
wait 0.6
keys enter
wait-for Checked
wait 1
shot hero
wait 0.5

caption greed.rs
wait 1.5
